{"id":"lish_","lemma":"лишь","pos":"adv","rank":159,"glosses":["only, merely, just","as soon as"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%88%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%88%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы лишь друзья.","en":"We're just friends.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я лишь хочу знать.","en":"I just want to know.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"}]},{"text":"Я лишь хотел кофе.","en":"I just wanted a coffee.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Есть лишь один ответ.","en":"There's only one answer.","words":[{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,{"g":"one"},{"g":"answer"}]},{"text":"Мы лишь хотим помочь тебе.","en":"We only want to help you.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"}]}]}